{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#3076","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#3076","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#3076\",\"parent_revision\":\"447b29c5bdd3ee3c165e92c69f9f4eee4bfac80d\",\"root_revision\":\"b46238ec102e3ba457eb49fb08284cd0ec01c5bf7184a0354caad0f447ba65fc\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: \\ntype: Feature\\nstatus: closed\\nadded: \\n-->\\n\\n## Decision Needed\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nRecorded as open question 5 in `docs/agent-markdown-consumption-contract.md`, with no backlog\\ntracking until now \u2014 despite the contract stating in the same document that #3062 \\\"cannot be\\nimplemented without\\\" this decision.\\n\\nR8 requires a stable identifier derived from the content a paginated response paginates.\\nUndecided: is that identifier derived from the raw markdown source, or from the parsed\\naddressable tree the engine builds from it?\\n\\nTrade-offs to weigh when deciding, not resolved here:\\n\\n- Raw-markdown-derived detects every source change, including ones that don't affect the\\n  addressable structure (e.g. whitespace-only edits), which may invalidate pagination more\\n  often than necessary.\\n- Parsed-tree-derived keeps pagination identity stable across cosmetic source edits, but\\n  requires the identity to be recomputed from a full parse rather than a cheap hash of raw\\n  bytes, and needs its own definition of what tree-equality means.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Why This Blocks Work\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n**#3062 is explicitly unplannable without this decision** \u2014 the identifier's derivation source\\ndetermines its computation cost and invalidation behavior, both acceptance-criteria-relevant.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Resolution\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nUpdate `docs/agent-markdown-consumption-contract.md`'s open-questions section to remove item 5\\nonce decided, and record the chosen derivation directly in R8 as a normative requirement.\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"ef89955693f0a6305cdd8487bb8cad3e4d22cd35682aba9bcced4b4ee8006993\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABP85AmQ\"}"}